# Context for `build/Dockerfile.kube-frontend-overlay`.
#
# The overlay copies four things and nothing else, so the context is deliberately
# tiny: everything below is excluded, and the Dockerfile's COPY lines are the
# allow-list. Without this file the repo's own `.dockerignore` applies — and it
# excludes `dist`, which is exactly where the server bundle lives.
*
!dist/server.js
!server/config.yaml
!server/locales/
!server/views/
!server/sample/
!server/public/
!.build/kube-frontend/dist/
